{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Reads, changes or resets the caller's personal Calendar page, which combines dated records of several lists with the caller's connected calendars. options returns the lists with date fields, their select colorFields and, when the plan and role allow it, the caller's own connected calendars, all by stable ID. read returns the configuration; while saved is false the caller sees a default with the first single date field of each list (else its first date range), up to twelve lists. update changes only the config keys it receives: sources and calendarIds each replace the whole list, so a submitted list carries the current entries, including the id of every source that is kept. Source filters use the same filter fields as the saved views of the surface records:<typeId>. The default timeZone is UTC; update returns the resulting configuration. reset removes the personal configuration, so the default applies again. These actions leave records, calendar events and other users' Calendar pages unchanged. subscriptions lists the caller's calendar subscription URLs; revoke permanently disables one and calendar apps subscribed to it stop updating.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"description":"options lists the lists with date fields and the caller's connected calendars; read returns the current configuration; update: config; reset removes the personal configuration; subscriptions lists calendar subscription URLs; revoke: id.","enum":["options","read","update","reset","subscriptions","revoke"],"type":"string"},"config":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"update only: the keys to change; sources and calendarIds replace the current lists.","properties":{"calendarIds":{"description":"The caller's own connected calendars to show;